 class=\"grec\">ἀπολύειν τινὰ τῆς αἰτίας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschn.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 254\nBaiter-Sauppe,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἀπολύσασθαι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Lys.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">13, 75 Baiter-Sauppe ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἀφιέναι τινὰ τῆς αἰτίας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 8 Baiter-Sauppe,</span>\ndécharger qqn d’une accusation ; <span class=\"grec\">ἐκτὸς αἰτίας\nκυρεῖς,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">330,</span> tu es à l’abri du\nreproche ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">en b.\npart,</span> ce qu’on impute à qqn, l’opinion qu’on a de qqn :\n<span class=\"grec\">αἰτίαν ἔχουσι βελτίους γεγονέναι,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Gorg.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">503</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, ils ont\nla réputation d’être devenus meilleurs ; <span class=\"grec\">ὧν πέρι\nαἰτίαν ἔχεις διαφέρειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Theæt.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">169</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>, sur tout cela tu as\nla réputation d’exceller ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\nsuite,</span> catégorie, classe où l’on place qqe ch. <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">645, 7</span> ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fleche\"><span class=\"flechea\">E</span> <span class=\"ital\">Ion.</span> <span class=\"grec\">-ίη,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">ll. cc</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">αἴτιος</span>.</div>\n"}]}